Year = {2010},
Volume = {16},
Number = {2},
Pages = {249-265},
Abstract = {This paper has as central topic the relation between leisure and urban
   space. There have been made thirty eight visits to the Ibirapuera Park
   (Sao Paulo). Through the method of anthropological research, we tried to
   understand the role of the differents uses that the same space can
   contain for the leisure pratices. The differences observed in the
   central track and the subversion presented by the marquise suggest the
   motto for these and others places to be able to become space for free
   time.},
