   Moiroux, N (Corresponding Author), Inst Pasteur, Pole Zool Med, Dakar, Senegal.
   Bartholomee, Colombine; Taconet, Paul; Mercat, Mathilde; Grail, Coralie; Fournet, Florence; Moiroux, Nicolas, Univ Montpellier, MIVEGEC, CNRS, IRD, Montpellier, France.
   Taconet, Paul, Univ Montpellier, CIRAD, CNRS, TETIS,Inrae,AgroParisTech, Montpellier, France.
